{"title":"Dune Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 2 times (1.8% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: venomChance: .2 | venomDamage: 6</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/deathstalker-venom\">Deathstalker Venom</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>68</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>52</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>3</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=25\" title=\"Pick level 25\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>68</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>52</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>2</td>